method:
I worked from decoded frames only, with no playback and no audio.

**What I read:** PLAYBOOK §4-§9, DIRECTION in full, TRANSCRIPT P08-P15, ledger rows C08-C14 (by grep), docs/ep06/fixes/S4/S5/S6_v2.json and range_S4-S6_v2.md. The v3 render logs for S4-S7 contain 0 '[kit]' warnings.

**Clip and static check:** I extracted 5074-9965 from out/ep06/v3/ep06_film.mp4 by decoded index into out/ep06/review/v3/S4-S6/clip_5074_9965.mp4 (4,892 frames, count verified). tools/static_check.py --offset 5074 reports 0 frozen stretches at both the 0.35 and 1.0 thresholds, and 0 empty frames.

**Images: 12 in total.**
- From tools/sheet.py (absolute frames):
  - overview sheets for S4, S5 and S6 every 30 f (53/60/52 frames, width 320);
  - three 640 px detail sheets of 12 text and beat frames each, one per section;
  - an S4 beats sheet (quote onset, copy-out/tray, race every 6 f);
  - an S5 beats sheet (flip every 6 f, housekeeping sweep every 6 f, chips);
  - an S6 sync sheet (QuestionCard exit and tags 8536-8560, split open 8644-8668, S5 erase-before-write 7350-7470, push 9512-9524);
  - a boundary sheet (5100-5110, 6640-6654, 8396-8410 and 9926-9948, every 2 f).
- Two native-resolution crop composites of my own:
  - race bottom run 6590-6646, tray edges at 5678/6620, the NTFS chip at 8380, and the flip at 7036/7050/7064;
  - disposable tags at 8556/8620/8670, the 9094 stage and the 9580 top edge.

**Measurements without images:**
- Cap heights from connected components of bright pixels on half-scale frames, about 35 text elements.
- Onset and exit series from per-frame bright-pixel counts in label boxes, using a frame-indexed grey memmap, for about 30 labels.
- RGB amber/cyan/coral fractions for:
  - the SSD-panel erase (8700-8770);
  - the tags (8530-8558);
  - the refusal (7296-7456);
  - the array refusal (9876-9920).
- Luma mean and std, and motion over 6-15 f gaps, for candidate holds (5180-5400, 6300-6450, 6650-6810, 7340-7560, 9070-9130) and the match-cut flash (6802-6830).
- Prop extents at the right and bottom edges (5600, 5678, 6575, 6620).
- Passport size in the tray.
- Top and side edge occupancy during the 9530-9660 push.

**Not done or not verifiable:** I rendered no full-res stills, because every must-read element measured at or above the half-scale floors. Determinism can't be verified from frames. The Archive's box ids, states and framings match across S3→S4→S5→S6→S7.

**Range score:** section scores weighted by length (1545/1755/1531 f).
